// Tabelle 4 — Merkmale und Eigenschaften von Niederdruck- und Mitteldruck-UV-Strahlern (figawa; §4.1.3.1, L524–L539).
// TRANSPOSED (rows = Merkmale, columns = the two lamp types) → the printed body L530–L537 is the quote of both rows.
// Every cell is kept as the printed string; `_min` / `_max` carry the numeric bounds where a range or a single figure is
